OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the headlines are often filled
OL,7,Fwith more serious stories, there are
OL,8,Fstill plenty of positive moments across
OL,9,Fthe West Midlands ` and we want to
OL,10,Fcelebrate them.
OL,12,FThis week, we have heard how Ade
OL,13,FAdepitan made history as the first
OL,14,Fwheelchair user to enter the I'm a
OL,15,FCelebrity jungle.
OL,17,FWe also heard from 16-year-old swimmer,
OL,18,FCharlotte Gower, after she was
OL,19,Fshortlisted for the Deaf Sports
OL,20,FPersonality of the Year award.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
